===Sydney Super Cup===
In November 2022, Celtic travelled to Australia to participate in the inaugural [[2022 Sydney Super Cup|Sydney Super Cup]], where they faced [[Sydney FC]] and [[Everton F.C.|Everton]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/july/07/everton-v-celtic-clash-to-headline-inaugural--sydney-super-cup-in-2022/ | title=Everton v Celtic clash to headline inaugural Sydney Super Cup in 2022 | publisher=Celtic FC | date=7 July 2022 | access-date=7 July 2022}}</ref>

