==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2022–23 Scottish Cup}}
On 28 November, Celtic were drawn to face [[Greenock Morton F.C.|Greenock Morton]] at Celtic Park in the fourth round of the [[2022–23 Scottish Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/november/28/celtic-face-greenock-morton-at-home-in-scottish-cup-fourth-round/ | title=Celtic face Greenock Morton at home in Scottish Cup fourth round | publisher=Celtic FC | date=28 November 2022 | access-date=28 November 2022}}</ref> On 22 January 2023, Celtic were drawn to face [[St Mirren F.C.|St Mirren]] at Celtic Park in the fifth round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/january/22/celts-to-play-st-mirren-in-fifth-round-of-the-scottish-cup/ | title=Celts to play St Mirren in fifth round of the Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=22 January 2023 | access-date=22 January 2023}}</ref> On 13 February, Celtic were drawn to face [[Heart of Midlothian F.C.|Heart of Midlothian]] at [[Tynecastle Park]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/february/13/celtic-face-away-tie-against-hearts-in-scottish-cup-quarter-final/ | title=Celtic face away tie against Hearts in Scottish Cup quarter-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 February 2023 | access-date=13 February 2023}}</ref> On 13 March, Celtic were drawn to face [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2023/march/13/celtic-to-face-rangers-in-scottish-cup-semi-final-at-hampden/ | title=Celtic to face Rangers in Scottish Cup semi-final at Hampden | publisher=Celtic FC | date=13 March 2023 | access-date=13 March 2023}}</ref> Celtic faced [[Inverness Caledonian Thistle F.C.|Inverness Caledonian Thistle]] in the final on 3 June.

