==Scottish League Cup==
{{Main|2022–23 Scottish League Cup}}
On 24 July, Celtic were drawn to face [[Ross County F.C.|Ross County]] in the second round of the [[2022–23 Scottish League Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/july/24/celtic-to-face-ross-county-in-the-last-16-of-the-league-cup/ | title=Celtic to face Ross County in the last 16 of the Premier Sports Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=24 July 2022 | access-date=24 July 2022}}</ref> On 31 August, Celtic were drawn to face [[Motherwell F.C.|Motherwell]] in the quarter-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/august/31/celtic-to-face-motherwell-away-in-the-league-cup-quarter-finals/ | title=Celtic to face Motherwell away in the League Cup quarter-finals | publisher=Celtic FC | date=31 August 2022 | access-date=31 August 2022}}</ref> On 19 October, Celtic were drawn to face [[Kilmarnock F.C.|Kilmarnock]] in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/october/19/celtic-face-kilmarnock-in-league-cup-semi-final/ | title=Celtic face Kilmarnock in League Cup semi-final | publisher=Celtic FC | date=19 October 2022 | access-date=19 October 2022}}</ref> On 15 January, it was determined that Celtic would face [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] in the final.

