==UEFA Champions League==
{{Main|2022–23 UEFA Champions League}}

===Group stage===
{{main|2022–23 UEFA Champions League group stage#Group F}}
Celtic entered the [[2022–23 UEFA Champions League]] at the group stage for the first time since the [[2008–09 Celtic F.C. season|2008–09]] season. On 25 August, the draw for the [[2022–23 UEFA Champions League#Group stage|group stage]] was made. Celtic were drawn in Group F along with [[Real Madrid CF|Real Madrid]], [[RB Leipzig]] and [[FC Shakhtar Donetsk|Shakhtar Donetsk]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/august/25/celtic-in-uefa-champions-league-group--/ | title=Celtic to face Real Madrid in Champions League group stage | publisher=Celtic FC | date=25 August 2022 | access-date=25 August 2022}}</ref>

{{2022–23 UEFA Champions League group tables|Group F|show_matches=yes|showteam=CEL}}

