*'''Home:''' The home kit features a subtle pattern within the club's traditional green and white hoops. White shorts and hooped socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/july/02/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2022-23-home-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2022/23 Home Kit: Pre-order Now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=2 July 2022 | access-date=5 July 2022}}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a black shirt with green and white pinstripes, and a shield-style club crest. The shirt is accompanied by black shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/june/10/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2022-23-away-kit---pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2022/23 Away Kit: Pre-order Now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 June 2022 | access-date=10 June 2022}}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features a light grey shirt with bright yellow details, and sleeve cuffs showcasing the geometric outline of Celtic Park. The shirt is accompanied by black shorts and light grey socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2022/august/01/adidas-x-celtic-fc-reveal-2022-23-third-kit--pre-order-now/ | title=adidas x Celtic FC reveal 2022/23 Third Kit: Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=1 August 2022 | access-date=1 August 2022}}</ref>

